 "description": "Fields of the entries in a backup (also journal and Android system-backup copy). «required»: the writer always writes the field (JSON null where «_OR_NULL»); missing or with another type → the whole backup is invalid, nothing is replaced (Android BackupFields.checkEntry, iOS BackupFields.checkEntry). «optional»: the writer omits it when empty; if present, its type counts. «sample» passes the check; without any required field it fails, without any optional field it passes. Each case in «invalid» changes one field of the sample of «part»; the entry must be invalid on both platforms. Invalid values (unknown kind, amount 0 …) are not part of this check: such entries are counted and named before the restore.",
